ScreenSense
ScreenSense - Week 1 Task Task Overview Performed Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on the Indian_Kids_Screen_Time dataset.

Project Statement Analyze kids’ screentime patterns to uncover trends by age, gender, location type (urban/rural), device type, day-of-week, and activity category using data visualization. The goal is to present clear, actionable insights for parents, educators, and policymakers. Tools Used *Jupyter Notebook

*Python

*Pandas

*matplotlib

*seaborn

*Numpy
